<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan sells electrical division.</title>
<headline>Cullinan sells electrical division.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cullinan Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had sold its electrical division with effect from November 1 in an attempt to reduce its high gearing levels.</p>
<p>It said the sale price was based on the electrical division's net asset value which was 21.9 million rand. Payment would be made in cash.</p>
<p>It did not name the purchaser.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
